# Integer8 addition at the type boundary

Verifies int8 addition at the upper boundary of the 8-bit range through the
complete CLI pipeline. Every operand is int8 to keep this case focused on
same-type boundary semantics.

>>> source
left: int8 = 100
right: int8 = 27
neg_left: int8 = -100

// Verifies addition reaching exactly the int8 maximum.
boundary_sum: int8 = left + right
print(boundary_sum)

// Verifies addition of a negative operand staying in range.
negative_sum: int8 = neg_left + right
print(negative_sum)

<<< stdout
127
-73

<<< stderr
